<title>USA: Continental Airlines launches fare sale.</title>
<headline>Continental Airlines launches fare sale.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Continental Airlines said Wednesday it was launching a fare sale for late summer and fall travel between selected U.S. cities.</p>
<p>None of the fares will be higher than $99 one way.</p>
<p>The carrier said fares must be bought by July 13 and that travel is valid August 18 through December 16, except for blackout dates.</p>
